 l_english:

 GER_The_Iron_Ring:0 "The Iron Ring"
 GER_The_Iron_Ring_desc:0 "The revisionists in Moscow believe they have us surrounded. With the French Commune pivoting toward the Soviet sphere and Starmer’s regime in London acting as a potential northern staging ground, Germany sits in a geographic vice. We must use our naval and economic might to choke out the West before we turn our eyes to the East."
 GER_Expand_Rhineland_Forts:0 "Expand the Rhineland Forts"
 GER_Expand_Rhineland_Forts_desc:0 "The Rhineland is the first line of defense against any potential French or British aggression. We must expand our fortifications in the region to ensure that we can hold the line against any potential attacks. This will require significant investment in both manpower and resources, but it is a necessary step to secure our borders and protect our nation from external threats."
 GER_Fund_Internal_Dissidents:0 "Fund Internal Dissidents"
 GER_Fund_Internal_Dissidents_desc:0 "Not everyone in France is pleased with the state’s submissive pivot toward Moscow's stagnant bureaucracy. By backing reformist and anti-Soviet factions within the French syndicates, we can tear their government apart from the inside."
 GER_The_Channel_Cordon:0 "The Channel Cordon"
 GER_The_Channel_Cordon_desc:0 "The English Channel is a critical chokepoint for any potential invasion of Britain. By establishing a cordon along the Channel, we can prevent the British from reinforcing their positions and limit their ability to project power across the sea. This will require significant naval resources and coordination, but it is a necessary step to ensure our success in any future conflict with the British. We must act quickly to establish this cordon and secure our position in the West."
 GER_target_the_french_economy:0 "Target the French Economy"
 GER_target_the_french_economy_desc:0 "The French Commune relies heavily on German machine parts and industrial exports. By cutting off these vital supply lines, we can stall their factory production before a single shot is fired."
 GER_Operation_Gotterdammerung:0 "Operation Götterdämmerung"
 GER_Operation_Gotterdammerung_desc:0 "The economic cage is locked. France is starving for resources. It is time to issue an absolute ultimatum to Paris: renounce Moscow, or face immediate military intervention."
  GER_Subjugation_of_the_Commune:0 "Subjugation of the Commune"
  GER_Subjugation_of_the_Commune_desc:0 "Whether through the thunder of our panzers or the subtle ink of a puppet treaty, the French threat has been neutralized. Their industry now serves the Reformist cause. The Commune is no more, and the French people are free to pursue their own destiny under the guidance of a new government. The world will remember this day as a turning point in history, where the forces of reform and progress triumphed over the forces of stagnation and oppression."
  GER_Force_a_Leadership_Coup:0 "Force a Leadership Coup"
  GER_Force_a_Leadership_Coup_desc:0 "The seeds of doubt have grown into a forest of rebellion. With French civil stability at an all-time low, our embedded operatives will back a sudden, coordinated ousting of the pro-Moscow administration. The French people will be grateful for our intervention, and the new government will be more amenable to our interests."
  GER_Re_evaluate_Alpine_Trade:0 "Re-evaluate Alpine Trade"
  GER_Re_evaluate_Alpine_Trade_desc:0 "Italy holds a dangerous position on our southern flank. We must reassess our transit agreements and infrastructure links through the mountains to ensure we hold the economic upper hand. If the Italians are unwilling to cooperate, we may need to consider more forceful measures to secure our trade routes and protect our national interests."
  GER_Infiltrate_the_Italian_Unions:0 "Infiltrate the Italian Unions"
  GER_Infiltrate_the_Italian_Unions_desc:0 "The Italian unions are a hotbed of pro-Moscow sentiment. By infiltrating these organizations, we can sow discord and weaken the Italian government from within. This will require careful planning and coordination, but it is a necessary step to ensure that Italy does not become a threat to our southern flank. We must act quickly to infiltrate the Italian unions and secure our position in the region."
  GER_Support_San_Marco_Separatists:0 "Support San Marco Separatists"
  GER_Support_San_Marco_Separatists_desc:0 "If the central government in Rome refuses to play ball, we will bypass them entirely. We will begin smuggling arms and funds to regional factions in Northern Italy who favor Berlin over Moscow."
  GER_The_Alpine_Ultimatum:0 "The Alpine Ultimatum"
  GER_The_Alpine_Ultimatum_desc:0 "Rome must understand that the Mediterranean is no longer safe for Soviet puppets. We will present them with a stark choice: join our economic sphere or watch German divisions march across their northern border and occupy their cities. The choice is theirs, but the consequences of refusal will be swift and decisive."
  GER_Secure_the_Brenner_Pass:0 "Secure the Brenner Pass"
  GER_Secure_the_Brenner_Pass_desc:0 "Should the Italians choose war, the Alps will become their graveyard. We will seize the high ground and lock down the transit passes, preparing a spearhead straight into the Po Valley. The Brenner Pass is the key to controlling Northern Italy, and we will not allow it to fall into enemy hands. Our forces will be ready to strike at a moment's notice, ensuring that we maintain the upper hand in any potential conflict with Italy."
  GER_Fund_a_Pro_Berlin_Faction:0 "Fund a Pro-Berlin Faction"
  GER_Fund_a_Pro_Berlin_Faction_desc:0 "The Italian government may be hesitant to align with Berlin, but there are factions within the country that are sympathetic to our cause. By providing financial support to these pro-Berlin groups, we can strengthen their influence and create a more favorable political environment for our interests. This will require careful vetting and monitoring of the groups we support, but it is a necessary step to ensure that Italy does not become a threat to our southern flank. We must act quickly to fund a pro-Berlin faction and secure our position in the region."
  GER_The_Southern_Flank_Secured:0 "The Southern Flank Secured"
  GER_The_Southern_Flank_Secured_desc:0 "The Italian question has been resolved. Rome is either a compliant partner in our new order or hopelessly trapped behind an iron curtain of Alpine fortifications."